@host = http://localhost:5036

### R1 empty list -> 400
POST {{host}}/api/v1/print/token
Content-Type: application/json

{ "musicSheetIds": [] }

### R2 unknown id -> 404
POST {{host}}/api/v1/print/token
Content-Type: application/json

{ "musicSheetIds": [999] }

### R3 wrong token -> 404
GET {{host}}/api/v1/print/print-information?token=falsch